<div class="big">88.3%<em>to</em><strong>90.8%</strong></div>
<p>Accuracy on 25K unseen IMDB reviews. A TF-IDF and Logistic Regression baseline against a fine-tuned DistilBERT (F1 0.907).</p>
<p>I read the wrong predictions afterwards. Most mistakes were sarcastic or mixed reviews.</p>
<div class="tools">Python, scikit-learn, Hugging Face, Google Colab</div></article>
